<BaseLayout title="Contact FenceCraft" description="Contact FenceCraft by phone or email about fencing, decking, landscaping and park maintenance.">
  <section class="wrap page-title"><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT</p><h1>Let’s have a conversation.</h1><p class="intro">Call, email or share a few details about the work. The quickest route is the one that suits you.</p></section>
  <section class="section sage"><div class="wrap contact-options"><article><p class="eyebrow">CALL</p><a href="tel:+447935190681">07935 190681</a><p>Click to call from a phone. If you leave a message, include your postcode and what you are considering.</p></article><article><p class="eyebrow">EMAIL</p><a href="mailto:info@fence-craft.co.uk">info@fence-craft.co.uk</a><p>Send a short outline, the location and your preferred way for us to reply.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW USEFUL DETAILS</p><h2>Name, postcode, service and a short description.</h2><p class="muted">Those basics make it easier to understand the right next step. A park enquiry should also include the site location, approximate scope and preferred timing.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="tel:+447935190681">Call FenceCraft</a><a class="btn outline" href="mailto:info@fence-craft.co.uk">Email us</a></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
